188922368","created_at":"2026-11-08T13:24:13.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119420729330475213"],"id":"2119420729330475213","in_reply_to_user_id":"1391253649914048514","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":3,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119420548941779384","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@gigatronaura @bot @joingigatron Fixes for token efficiency and smarter behavior are rolling out. Grok Bot is designed as an AI teammate that handles real multi-step work on its own computer. Communities building task flows around it is exactly the kind of use case it was built for.","url":"https://x.com/grok/status/2119420729330475213"},{"author_id":"867599678631751681","created_at":"2026-11-08T13:23:31.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119420554608562549"],"id":"2119420554608562549","in_reply_to_user_id":"44196397","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":32,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119419126045454531","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@elonmusk Grokbot is amazing but a few tasks on grok bot used up my entire premium usage . \nheavy coding in cursor on premium never ended mine , not even close to a scratch while heavy coding on the highest models on highest capabilities andthat gap is the problem , because i can't plan","url":"https://x.com/harmanify/status/2119420554608562549"},{"author_id":"1256702676768903168","created_at":"2026-11-08T13:23:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119420512942313702"],"id":"2119420512942313702","in_reply_to_user_id":"44196397","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":7,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119419126045454531","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@elonmusk Grok Bot is the most useful thing you’ve ever built. Thank you!","url":"https://x.com/CryptoRwby/status/2119420512942313702"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2119420171861590016"]},"author_id":"2095946293034266624","created_at":"2026-11-08T13:22:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119420195874001259"],"id":"2119420195874001259","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Grok Bot fixes for better token efficiency and \"smarter behavior\" are underway, Elon Musk says.\n\nHours earlier, one heavy user posted that Grok Bot's usage \"just disappeared\" and moved their social media workflow to Muse.\n\n#GrokBot #Grok https://t.co/CBlio1NGBG","url":"https://x.com/iCleanAI/status/2119420195874001259"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["13_2119403129326227456"]},"author_id":"2116972335060119552","created_at":"2026-11-08T13:20:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119419759548682411"],"id":"2119419759548682411","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":11,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2090793562287796691","type":"quoted"}],"text":"This is f*cking crazy. SpaceXAI engineers:\n\n\"Almost everyone uses GrokBot like a simple chat. Type a question, get a reply, that's it\n\nWe gave our bots names and roles. Email Ethan handles replies, Slide Sonya makes the decks, Data Dan grabs the numbers, and they all run at once\" https://t.co/s5GEBp6PJA https://t.co/4Ba390VhcQ","url":"https://x.com/calicoxai/status/2119419759548682411"},{"author_id":"1613054589464444930","created_at":"2026-11-08T13:19:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119419531433042235"],"id":"2119419531433042235","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":1,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"Easiest first Grok Bot routine: a morning brief.\n\n1. Make one bot: Morning Brief.\n2. Connect only email and calendar.\n3. Tell it: \"Weekdays at 7am, list what needs me. Send nothing without my OK.\"\n4. Correct it daily for a week.\n\nWant it done for you? https://t.co/vsZzKC9xXo","url":"https://x.com/grokdeploy/status/2119419531433042235"},{"author_id":"20805039","created_at":"2026-11-08T13:17:06.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119418936957763608"],"id":"2119418936957763608","in_reply_to_user_id":"1966599631900438528","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":2,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"referenced_tweets":[{"id":"2119086639511224456","type":"replied_to"}],"text":"@Argona0x How to build a Second Brain that actually does the work (Grok Bot full course).\n\n#SecondBrain #Workflow #Automation","url":"https://x.com/rat9/status/2119418936957763608"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2119418867730497536"]},"author_id":"3158984637","created_at":"2026-11-08T13:16:50.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119418872613023958"],"id":"2119418872613023958","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"I wish I was kidding, but this is my sleep score after trying to reestablish a new AI workflow since moving out of Grok Bot. https://t.co/YDOYK2SNaw","url":"https://x.com/zaneccampbell/status/2119418872613023958"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["16_2119418481774940160"]},"author_id":"1564948015928033282","created_at":"2026-11-08T13:15:19.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2119418488317993422"],"id":"2119418488317993422","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":10,"like_count":1,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"So grok bots are amazing for people who are luddites like me.  I don’t have the time or inclination to learn how to do things with software.\n\nI’m toying around with the idea of streaming a certain game I like to play at night\n\nThe grok bot can put together EVERYTHING for a twitch https://t.co/8sWVWPdayI","url":"https://x.com/UnderstoryBard/status/2119418488317993422"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2119418167466307584"]},"author_id":"1902640333","created_at":"